{"title":"牧羊人","url":"https://www.shephe.com/","favicon":"https://www.shephe.com/favicon.ico","elements":[{"title":"Lightroom Classic 重磅更新：一键智能移除照片中的干扰人物","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/lightroom-classic-distraction-removal-people/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Lightroom Classic 重磅更新：一键智能移除照片中的干扰人物</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Lightroom-blue.webp 1536w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Lightroom-blue-768x512.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-09-10T12:00:57+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t09/10/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>Lightroom Classic 重磅更新：一键智能移除照片中的干扰人物</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>在日常拍摄中，我们常常遇到这样的问题：好不容易捕捉到完美的构图，却总有“路人甲”闯入画面，破坏了整体氛围。过去，我们可能需要借助复杂的修图技巧才能抹掉这些背景人物。而现在，Lightroom Classic 带来了一项全新 AI 功能——「…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/lightroom-classic-distraction-removal-people/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/lightroom-classic-distraction-removal-people/","retrieved":1757526282586},{"title":"Adobe 账户的“生成式积分”是什么？怎么查余额","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/post/adobe-generative-credits-balance/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Adobe 账户的“生成式积分”是什么？怎么查余额</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/website-seo-optimize-title-and-description-tags.svg\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-09-08T23:52:09+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t09/08/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>Adobe 账户的“生成式积分”是什么？怎么查余额</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Adobe 近几年在生成式 AI 上投入巨大，尤其是 Firefly 图像生成以及 Photoshop 的生成式填充功能，让很多用户体验到了 AI 在创作中的便利。但在使用时，不少人会遇到一个新概念——生成式积分。很多人一开始并不清楚，这个…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/post/adobe-generative-credits-balance/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/post/adobe-generative-credits-balance/","retrieved":1757526282589},{"title":"飞来横祸！爸爸走在路边被车撞飞了…","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/%e7%88%b6%e4%ba%b2%e8%bd%a6%e7%a5%b8/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">飞来横祸！爸爸走在路边被车撞飞了…</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/20250904-康定建筑.webp 1067w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/20250904-康定建筑-512x768.webp 512w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-09-08T09:05:21+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t09/08/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>飞来横祸！爸爸走在路边被车撞飞了…</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>七夕上午，我一边忙着工作的事儿一边在收拾家里，准备第二天会老家给奶奶过生日，同时看看已有一月未见的果果，可不曾想接到妈妈的电话，她略带哭腔的说：你爸爸被车撞了...！ 我第一反应是追问人伤得怎么样，听到“暂时没有生命危险”才稍微松了一口气。…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/%e7%88%b6%e4%ba%b2%e8%bd%a6%e7%a5%b8/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/life/%e7%88%b6%e4%ba%b2%e8%bd%a6%e7%a5%b8/","retrieved":1757526282591},{"title":"仿钟祖兵色调预设，纪实电影感婚礼照片 LR 预设","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/resources/%e4%bb%bf%e9%92%9f%e7%a5%96%e5%85%b5%e9%a2%84%e8%ae%be/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">仿钟祖兵色调预设，纪实电影感婚礼照片 LR 预设</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/tea-cat-studio1.webp 1067w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/tea-cat-studio1-512x768.webp 512w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-08-29T09:45:54+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t08/29/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>仿钟祖兵色调预设，纪实电影感婚礼照片 LR 预设</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>在婚礼摄影中，调色的风格往往决定了作品的气质与灵魂。近年来，“钟祖兵风格”成为许多摄影师和新人喜欢的风格。这种以暗调电影感为核心的审美突破了传统明亮、饱和的婚礼影像，营造出如同电影场景般的氛围感，让婚礼影像不再只是记录，而是具有温度与情绪的…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/resources/%e4%bb%bf%e9%92%9f%e7%a5%96%e5%85%b5%e9%a2%84%e8%ae%be/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/resources/%e4%bb%bf%e9%92%9f%e7%a5%96%e5%85%b5%e9%a2%84%e8%ae%be/","retrieved":1757526282592},{"title":"Goodbye, Memos","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/goodbye-memos/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Goodbye, Memos</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/shephe.com_08-28_10-39.webp 1600w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/shephe.com_08-28_10-39-768x432.webp 768w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/shephe.com_08-28_10-39-1390x782.webp 1390w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-08-28T11:19:10+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t08/28/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>Goodbye, Memos</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>我翻了翻自己在 Memos 上的第一条动态，是在 2024 年年中发的。那时候应该是看了五木大神的帖子「</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/life/goodbye-memos/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/life/goodbye-memos/","retrieved":1757526282594},{"title":"WordPress 服务器性能测试优化方案 & 迁移记录","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/website/aliyun-to-baidu-cloud-migration/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">WordPress 服务器性能测试优化方案 &amp; 迁移记录</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Server-Room.webp 1200w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Server-Room-768x432.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-08-26T18:42:52+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t08/26/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>WordPress 服务器性能测试优化方案 &amp; 迁移记录</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>前段时间，我抢了一台腾讯的轻量云服务器，本来都已经把本站迁移过去了，但结果发现那台机器的性能实在太差了，动不动就卡爆，只好回退到阿里云这边了。通过这次迁移，我倒是把整个过程走了一遍，积累了一些经验。同时，也让我重新考虑换服务器的事。这仔细一…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/website/aliyun-to-baidu-cloud-migration/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/website/aliyun-to-baidu-cloud-migration/","retrieved":1757526282597},{"title":"索尼 A7R3A 还值得买么？怎么设置颜色最好看？","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/photography/sony-a7r3-setting/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">索尼 A7R3A 还值得买么？怎么设置颜色最好看？</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Sensual-Woman-Lying-on-Sofa-org.webp 1600w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Sensual-Woman-Lying-on-Sofa-org-768x512.webp 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-08-20T19:17:30+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t08/20/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>索尼 A7R3A 还值得买么？怎么设置颜色最好看？</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Sony A7R3A 是 A7R3 的换皮版本，发布于 2021 年 10 月，主要升级了品木和一个接口（USB 3.2），大的升级几乎没有。而索尼 A7R3 发布于 2017 年，它是当时影像领域的经典之作，搭载了 4240 万像素的全画…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/photography/sony-a7r3-setting/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/photography/sony-a7r3-setting/","retrieved":1757526282599},{"title":"斐讯 N1 重装 Armbian：从家用小 NAS 到容器管理","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/post/phicomm-n1-setup-armbian-gogogo/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">斐讯 N1 重装 Armbian：从家用小 NAS 到容器管理</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/in-2019.07.13-at-Home-折腾N1.jpg 1920w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/07/in-2019.07.13-at-Home-折腾N1-768x492.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-08-18T11:37:06+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t08/18/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>斐讯 N1 重装 Armbian：从家用小 NAS 到容器管理</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>前不久，我忘了斐讯 N1 的密码登不进系统了，尽管尝试了几天，依然无法找回正确的密码。更糟糕的是，一些需要手动启动的服务也无法正常运行。经过一番挣扎后，我决定重装系统，看看这台六年前花了一百多块钱买的小机器，是否还能承载新的系统，看看它在时…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/post/phicomm-n1-setup-armbian-gogogo/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/post/phicomm-n1-setup-armbian-gogogo/","retrieved":1757526282600},{"title":"Rybbit Analytics：开源流量统计安装 & 简单体验","contents":"<a class=\"grve-item-url\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/rybbit-analytics/\" rel=\"bookmark\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Rybbit Analytics：开源流量统计安装 &amp; 简单体验</span></a>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-media\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-media-inner grve-radius-none grve-shadow-none\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-background-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-bg-image lazyload\" data-bgset=\"https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/chrome-devtools-performance-tab-1920x1008.png 1920w, https://www.shephe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/chrome-devtools-performance-tab-768x403.png 768w\" data-sizes=\"auto\"></div>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-date grve-h5 grve-heading-color\">\t\t\t<time datetime=\"2025-07-29T17:37:41+08:00\">\n\t\t\t\t07/29/2025\t\t\t</time>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grve-post-content\">\n\t\t\t<h2 class=\"grve-post-title grve-heading-color grve-h3\" itemprop=\"headline\"><span>Rybbit Analytics：开源流量统计安装 &amp; 简单体验</span></h2>\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>大概两周前，我把网站的流量统计系统从 Matomo 换成了 Umami。这是一款开源、免费、界面简洁的流量分析工具，部署方便，使用起来也比较顺畅。但实际体验下来，问题也不少。最让我无法忽视的一点是数据失真：访问量看起来非常可疑，怀疑是把搜索…</p>\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<a class=\"grve-read-more grve-link-text\" href=\"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/rybbit-analytics/\"><span>查看全文</span>\t\t\t\t<svg width=\"40px\" height=\"16px\" viewBox=\"0 0 40 16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-line\" points=\"0 7 38 7 38 9 0 9\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t\t<polygon class=\"grve-arrow-point\" points=\"31.3481912 0 40 8 31.3481912 16 30 14.5816219 37.1 8 30 1.41837809\"></polygon>\n\t\t\t\t</svg>\n\t\t\t</a>","link":"https://www.shephe.com/tutorial/rybbit-analytics/","retrieved":1757526282602}]}